{% set ba = data.bank_account %}
{% set conf = data.confirmation %}
{% set period_end = task.params.period_end %}
You assist a registered company auditor with the audit of an Australian financial report for the year ended {{ period_end }}.

## Task

The bank's confirmed balance for account {{ ba.account_no }} (ID {{ subject_id }}, {{ ba.bank_name }}) differs from the book balance. Investigate the difference and decide whether it indicates a misstatement (ASA505-P14).

- Confirmed balance: {{ conf.confirmed_balance_cents }} cents as at {{ conf.balance_date }}
- Book balance (GL account {{ ba.gl_account_code }}) at {{ period_end }}: {{ data.book_balance_cents }} cents
- Difference, confirmed minus book: {{ data.difference_cents }} cents

